      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そもそも、人間というのは、\n結婚という制度を持っていますね。\n異性と愛を育み、子孫を残す為のものです。",
      "jp_sha256": "587b191ac9306568372be6596babcae2c3a76d85efdc9e7e46f87720ac7369e1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "애초에 인간에게는,\n결혼이라는 제도가 있지요.\n이성과 사랑을 키우고 후손을 남기기 위한 것이에요.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8090e59c3e89a577369a95f65b939d27c92d9d35e2a9cfbb40dd63dbbe2afade:000000_-8821099953932758507:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アルギュロアイギスコス",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "そもそも、人間というのは、\n結婚という制度を持っていますね。\n異性と愛を育み、子孫を残す為のものです。",
        "",
        "ch_10373/R18/10373B0_10373_Nml/10373B0_10373_002",
